// Wave 17C-1 (R2): Live `stillfail-runner` process spawning, Unix socket NDJSON+ACK turn execution
// loop, runtime stdout event parsing via `parse_claude` / `parse_codex` / `parse_acp`,
// `OwnProcessStopGuard` / `AcpTurnGuard` / `AgyStateTracker` lifecycle guards, `<message>` envelope
// + `<skill-invocation>` delivery, strict cross-workspace profile/CWD/SSE isolation,
// real Codex & ACP wire handshakes, and seamless `SIGUSR2` handover live-turn adoption & reuse.

